        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1069">

                <pb facs="1048" n="950" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg950"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-05-23"><hi rendition="#italic">May 23,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 451.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my dispatch Mo. 449, I have
                    the honor to inclose a letter from the United States consul at La Guaira, in
                    which he criticises in detail the statements made to General Castro by the jefes
                    civiles at La Guaira respecting his recent unpleasant experiences at that
                    port.</p>
                <p>This letter only reached me to-day.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis B.
                    Loomis.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d1069-a1.xml" xpointer="d1069-a1"/>
